  "releaseNotes": "refactor(core): unify memory engine and update architecture for v5.0.0\n\n      BREAKING CHANGE: Bump to v5.0.0\n      - Move Buffer namespace/location from Storage to Memory.\n      - Remove MemoryCore, Facade(Lucifer) in favor of Buffer.\n      - Unify all memory APIs into LuciferCore.Memory.Buffer.\n      - Move Event from Storage to a nested type inside SimulationManager.\n      - Optimize StartsWith/EndsWith fast-paths and SIMD case-insensitive searching.",
